{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "游戏厅机器人接口",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "群里小游戏的通用协议：**群友的机器人实现这些接口，荷官（Dealer）来调用**。荷官是裁判和牌局状态的唯一来源，机器人只做决定、自己在群里说话。说明文档见 `docs/游戏厅-通用协议.md`。\n\n- 所有游戏共用 4 个接口，用路径里的 `{game}` 区分游戏；每个游戏的请求体、动作、事件在 components 里各占一组 schema（名字以游戏名开头）。\n- 签名：请求头 `X-Tavern-Timestamp`（Unix 秒）和 `X-Tavern-Signature`（`sha256=` + 十六进制），签名原文为 `时间戳.方法.路径.原始请求体`（方法大写，路径不含域名和查询串），密钥是双方私下约定的一串随机字符，**不是飞书的 App Secret**。签名不对或时间戳相差超过 300 秒返回 401。\n- 顺序：荷官给每个机器人的请求严格按先后一个个发，`seq` 从 1 起连续递增（荷官重启后重新从 1 开始）。做决定只看 decision 请求本身带的局面。\n- 兼容：看不懂的字段忽略；不支持的游戏在邀请时回 `accept: false` 或 404；只有不兼容的改动才升路径版本（/v2）。\n\n**增加一个游戏**：① `GameKey` 的 enum 加上游戏名；② 新增 `<游戏>RoundStart`、`<游戏>DecisionRequest`、`<游戏>Decision`、各个 `<游戏>…Event` schema；③ 把它们加进 `RoundStart`、`DecisionRequest`、`Decision`、`Event` 的 oneOf（前两个同时加进 discriminator 的 mapping）；④ 在 `tags` 里加一个同名标签，并写一份 `docs/游戏厅-<游戏>规格.md`。路径不用改。"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{host}/{base}",
      "description": "你的机器人的基础地址（私下约定）",
      "variables": {
        "host": {
          "default": "your-bot.example.com"
        },
        "base": {
          "default": "tavern"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "TavernTimestamp": [],
      "TavernSignature": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "通用",
      "description": "所有游戏共用的接口和数据结构"
    },
    {
      "name": "liars_bar",
      "description": "骗子酒馆，规格见 docs/游戏厅-骗子酒馆规格.md"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/games/{game}/invitations": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "通用"
        ],
        "operationId": "invite",
        "summary": "邀请上桌",
        "description": "开局前桌上需要补机器人时调用，3 秒内回复。会玩这个游戏、现在方便就回 `accept: true`；否则回 `false`。404、超时、出错都当作不来。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Game"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Invitation"
              },
              "example": {
                "protocol": 1,
                "seq": 1,
                "game": "liars_bar",
                "match_id": "m_example_123",
                "chat_id": "oc_example",
                "humans": [
                  "Alice"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "接不接",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/InvitationReply"
                },
                "example": {
                  "accept": true
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "不支持这个游戏（等同 accept: false）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/games/{game}/matches/{match_id}/rounds/{round}": {
      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "通用"
        ],
        "operationId": "startRound",
        "summary": "新一轮的私有信息",
        "description": "每轮开始（比如新发了牌）调用，带着你这一轮的私有信息。同一轮重复收到时以最后一次为准。立即回复。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Game"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/MatchId"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Round"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RoundStart"
              },
              "example": {
                "protocol": 1,
                "seq": 12,
                "game": "liars_bar",
                "match_id": "m_example_123",
                "chat_id": "oc_example",
                "turn_id": 30,
                "you": {
                  "seat": 2,
                  "name": "Carol"
                },
                "round": 3,
                "target": "K",
                "hand": [
                  {
                    "slot": 1,
                    "card": "Q"
                  },
                  {
                    "slot": 2,
                    "card": "K"
                  },
                  {
                    "slot": 3,
                    "card": "JOKER"
                  },
                  {
                    "slot": 4,
                    "card": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "slot": 5,
                    "card": "K"
                  }
                ],
                "order": [
                  {
                    "seat": 0,
                    "name": "Alice"
                  },
                  {
                    "seat": 1,
                    "name": "Bob"
                  },
                  {
                    "seat": 2,
                    "name": "Carol"
                  }
                ],
                "first": 0
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "收到（响应体 `{}`）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "example": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "204": {
            "description": "收到（无响应体）"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/games/{game}/matches/{match_id}/turns/{turn_id}/decision": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "通用"
        ],
        "operationId": "decide",
        "summary": "轮到你：给出动作",
        "description": "请求体带着做决定需要的完整局面。15 秒内回复（建议 3 秒内）；超时、出错、动作不合法、turn_id 对不上，这一手由荷官代打，连续 3 次失败本局不再找你。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Game"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/MatchId"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/TurnId"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DecisionRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "protocol": 1,
                "seq": 20,
                "game": "liars_bar",
                "match_id": "m_example_123",
                "chat_id": "oc_example",
                "turn_id": 37,
                "you": {
                  "seat": 2,
                  "name": "Carol"
                },
                "round": 3,
                "target": "K",
                "hand": [
                  {
                    "slot": 2,
                    "card": "K"
                  },
                  {
                    "slot": 3,
                    "card": "JOKER"
                  },
                  {
                    "slot": 4,
                    "card": "A"
                  }
                ],
                "can_challenge": true,
                "must_challenge": false,
                "last_play": {
                  "seat": 1,
                  "name": "Bob",
                  "count": 2
                },
                "pile": 3,
                "players": [
                  {
                    "seat": 0,
                    "name": "Alice",
                    "alive": true,
                    "cards_left": 4,
                    "shots_fired": 1,
                    "is_bot": false
                  },
                  {
                    "seat": 1,
                    "name": "Bob",
                    "alive": true,
                    "cards_left": 2,
                    "shots_fired": 0,
                    "is_bot": true
                  },
                  {
                    "seat": 2,
                    "name": "Carol",
                    "alive": true,
                    "cards_left": 3,
                    "shots_fired": 2,
                    "is_bot": true
                  }
                ],
                "log": [
                  "第 3 小局开始，目标牌 K",
                  "Alice出了 1 张（声称都是 K），还剩 4 张。",
                  "Bob出了 2 张（声称都是 K），还剩 2 张。"
                ],
                "chat": [
                  {
                    "name": "Alice",
                    "text": "Carol你手里肯定没 K"
                  }
                ],
                "deadline_ms": 15000
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "动作（按路径里的 game 选对应游戏的 Decision schema）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Decision"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "liars_bar_play": {
                    "summary": "骗子酒馆：出 3、4 号位",
                    "value": {
                      "turn_id": 37,
                      "action": "play",
                      "slots": [
                        3,
                        4
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "liars_bar_challenge": {
                    "summary": "骗子酒馆：质疑",
                    "value": {
                      "turn_id": 37,
                      "action": "challenge"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/games/{game}/matches/{match_id}/events": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "通用"
        ],
        "operationId": "receiveEvent",
        "summary": "公开事件",
        "description": "牌桌上发生的公开的事，事后通知，立即回复。想说话就用你自己的机器人发到 chat_id 对应的群里。",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/Game"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/MatchId"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Event"
              },
              "examples": {
                "game_over": {
                  "summary": "本局结束（通用）",
                  "value": {
                    "protocol": 1,
                    "seq": 21,
                    "game": "liars_bar",
                    "match_id": "m_example_123",
                    "chat_id": "oc_example",
                    "turn_id": 39,
                    "you": {
                      "seat": 2,
                      "name": "Carol"
                    },
                    "event": "game_over",
                    "winner": {
                      "seat": 1,
                      "name": "Bob"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "liars_bar_shot": {
                  "summary": "骗子酒馆：开枪",
                  "value": {
                    "protocol": 1,
                    "seq": 21,
                    "game": "liars_bar",
                    "match_id": "m_example_123",
                    "chat_id": "oc_example",
                    "turn_id": 39,
                    "you": {
                      "seat": 2,
                      "name": "Carol"
                    },
                    "event": "shot",
                    "seat": 2,
                    "name": "Carol",
                    "result": "click",
                    "shots_fired": 3,
                    "nth": 3
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "收到（响应体 `{}`）",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object"
                },
                "example": {}
              }
            }
          },
          "204": {
            "description": "收到（无响应体）"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "TavernTimestamp": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Tavern-Timestamp",
        "description": "发出请求时的 Unix 时间（秒）。和你的时钟相差超过 300 秒就拒绝。"
      },
      "TavernSignature": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Tavern-Signature",
        "description": "`sha256=` + HMAC_SHA256(密钥, `时间戳.方法.路径.原始请求体`) 的十六进制。对收到的原始字节验签后再解析 JSON，比较用恒定时间函数。"
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "签名不对或时间戳过期，不处理"
      }
    },
    "parameters": {
      "Game": {
        "name": "game",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GameKey"
        }
      },
      "MatchId": {
        "name": "match_id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "description": "这一局的编号"
      },
      "Round": {
        "name": "round",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "description": "第几轮"
      },
      "TurnId": {
        "name": "turn_id",
        "in": "path",
        "required": true,
        "schema": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "description": "回合号，回复时原样带回"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "GameKey": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "liars_bar"
        ],
        "description": "游戏名。新游戏上线时往这里加。"
      },
      "Seat": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "seat": {
            "type": [
              "integer",
              "null"
            ],
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "seat",
          "name"
        ]
      },
      "Common": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "除邀请外，每个请求体都带的公共字段。看不懂的其他字段一律忽略。",
        "properties": {
          "protocol": {
            "const": 1,
            "description": "协议版本"
          },
          "seq": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "description": "发给你的第几个请求，严格递增，可用于去重、判断先后"
          },
          "game": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GameKey"
          },
          "match_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "这一局的编号，和路径一致"
          },
          "chat_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "在哪个飞书群，台词发到这里"
          },
          "turn_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "本局回合号，从 0 开始只增不减；同一回合的几个请求可能共用一个 turn_id"
          },
          "you": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Seat"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "protocol",
          "seq",
          "game",
          "match_id",
          "chat_id",
          "turn_id",
          "you"
        ]
      },
      "Invitation": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "protocol": {
            "const": 1
          },
          "seq": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "game": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GameKey"
          },
          "match_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "chat_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "humans": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "已经上桌的真人"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "protocol",
          "seq",
          "game",
          "match_id",
          "chat_id",
          "humans"
        ]
      },
      "InvitationReply": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "accept": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "accept"
        ]
      },
      "DecisionBase": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "所有游戏的动作都有这两个字段，其余字段由各游戏定义",
        "properties": {
          "turn_id": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "和路径里的 turn_id 一致"
          },
          "action": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "turn_id",
          "action"
        ]
      },
      "GameOverEvent": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "本局结束（所有游戏通用）",
            "properties": {
              "event": {
                "const": "game_over"
              },
              "winner": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Seat"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ],
                "description": "null 表示没有赢家（中途散场）"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "event",
              "winner"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "RoundStart": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarRoundStart"
          }
        ],
        "discriminator": {
          "propertyName": "game",
          "mapping": {
            "liars_bar": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarRoundStart"
          }
        }
      },
      "DecisionRequest": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarDecisionRequest"
          }
        ],
        "discriminator": {
          "propertyName": "game",
          "mapping": {
            "liars_bar": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarDecisionRequest"
          }
        }
      },
      "Decision": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarDecision"
          }
        ],
        "description": "按路径里的 game 选对应游戏的动作"
      },
      "Event": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GameOverEvent"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarPlayEvent"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarChallengeEvent"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarShotEvent"
          }
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarCard": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "Q",
          "K",
          "A",
          "JOKER"
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarHandCard": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "slot": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 5
          },
          "card": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarCard"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "slot",
          "card"
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarPlayer": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "seat": {
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "name": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "alive": {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "cards_left": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "shots_fired": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "这把枪已空响几次；下一枪中弹概率 1/(6-shots_fired)"
          },
          "is_bot": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "seat",
          "name",
          "alive",
          "cards_left",
          "shots_fired",
          "is_bot"
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarRoundStart": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "game": {
                "const": "liars_bar"
              },
              "round": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1
              },
              "target": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "Q",
                  "K",
                  "A"
                ],
                "description": "本小局目标牌"
              },
              "hand": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarHandCard"
                },
                "description": "你的手牌（私有）"
              },
              "order": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Seat"
                },
                "description": "座次"
              },
              "first": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "这一小局先出牌的座位"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "round",
              "target",
              "hand",
              "order",
              "first"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarDecisionRequest": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "game": {
                "const": "liars_bar"
              },
              "round": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "target": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "Q",
                  "K",
                  "A"
                ]
              },
              "hand": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarHandCard"
                }
              },
              "can_challenge": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "本小局第一手为 false"
              },
              "must_challenge": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "只剩你手里有牌时为 true，只能质疑"
              },
              "last_play": {
                "oneOf": [
                  {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "seat": {
                        "type": "integer"
                      },
                      "name": {
                        "type": "string"
                      },
                      "count": {
                        "type": "integer",
                        "minimum": 1,
                        "maximum": 3
                      }
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "seat",
                      "name",
                      "count"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "null"
                  }
                ],
                "description": "上一手：谁、出了几张；第一手为 null"
              },
              "pile": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "description": "本小局大家一共声称出了几张目标牌"
              },
              "players": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarPlayer"
                }
              },
              "log": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "description": "最近的公开播报"
              },
              "chat": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "name": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "text": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "description": "牌局期间群里最近 10 条不是指令的发言"
              },
              "deadline_ms": {
                "type": "integer",
                "description": "回复时限（毫秒）"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "round",
              "target",
              "hand",
              "can_challenge",
              "must_challenge",
              "last_play",
              "pile",
              "players"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarDecision": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarPlay"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarChallenge"
          }
        ],
        "discriminator": {
          "propertyName": "action",
          "mapping": {
            "play": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarPlay",
            "challenge": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarChallenge"
          }
        }
      },
      "LiarsBarPlay": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DecisionBase"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "扣着出牌，一律声称是目标牌；must_challenge 为 true 时不能用",
            "properties": {
              "action": {
                "const": "play"
              },
              "slots": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 1,
                  "maximum": 5
                },
                "minItems": 1,
                "maxItems": 3,
                "uniqueItems": true,
                "description": "要出的牌的位置号，必须在手里"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "slots"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarChallenge": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DecisionBase"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "质疑上一家；can_challenge 为 true 时才能用",
            "properties": {
              "action": {
                "const": "challenge"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarPlayEvent": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "有人出了几张",
            "properties": {
              "event": {
                "const": "play"
              },
              "seat": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "count": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "cards_left": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "game": {
                "const": "liars_bar"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "event",
              "seat",
              "name",
              "count",
              "cards_left"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarChallengeEvent": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "有人质疑，翻牌结果",
            "properties": {
              "event": {
                "const": "challenge"
              },
              "challenger": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Seat"
              },
              "accused": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Seat"
              },
              "revealed": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LiarsBarCard"
                }
              },
              "lied": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "description": "上一家有没有撒谎"
              },
              "shooter": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Seat"
              },
              "game": {
                "const": "liars_bar"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "event",
              "challenger",
              "accused",
              "revealed",
              "lied",
              "shooter"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "LiarsBarShotEvent": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "开枪",
            "properties": {
              "event": {
                "const": "shot"
              },
              "seat": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "result": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "click",
                  "bang",
                  "misfire"
                ],
                "description": "click 空枪、bang 中弹出局、misfire 哑火"
              },
              "shots_fired": {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              "nth": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 1,
                "description": "这把枪自上次装弹以来的第几枪"
              },
              "game": {
                "const": "liars_bar"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "event",
              "seat",
              "name",
              "result",
              "shots_fired",
              "nth"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}